graph TD
    developer[Developer] -->|git push| git[Git Repository]
    git --> pipeline[CI/CD Pipeline]
    
    pipeline -->|cfn-lint| lint[Linter]
    lint -->|Create Change Set| changeset[CFN Change Set]
    
    changeset -->|Review| manual[Manual Approval]
    manual -->|Execute| stack[CloudFormation Stack]
    
    stack -->|Creates| vpc[VPC]
    stack -->|Creates| ec2[EC2 Instance]
    stack -->|Creates| rds[RDS Database]
    
    drift[Manual Console Change] -.->|Drifts| ec2
    stack -->|Detect Drift| alert[Drift Alert]
